        "pkcontributionId": 125993,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 139,
        "headingId": 779,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> a well-circumscribed dermal nodule composed of solid aggregates of matrical cells with numerous scattered dendritic pigmented melanocytes and melanin deposits.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-24T18:23:17"
      }
    ],
